# Check text files out with LF line endings on every operating system.
# The lecturer's make_submission.py compares treeplex_representation.py byte for
# byte with the provided file, and the experiment records hold raw-byte source
# hashes, so a Windows checkout must not rewrite these files with CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary evidence and deliverables are never converted.
*.npz binary
*.gz binary
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.zip binary
